# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived data and raw datasets (24 GB on disk; all of it is regenerable)
#
# Every phase folder keeps its intermediate artifacts in data/ or embeddings/.
# These are outputs of the scripts in the same folder, not source, and the raw
# datasets are public downloads. See README.md for how to rebuild them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
embeddings/
*.npz
*.tar
*.zip
*.gz
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.h5
*.mat

# Model checkpoints are excluded by default; the final systems the paper
# reports are re-included below so results can be reproduced without training.
*.pt
*.pth
!week7/phase27_text_and_category/models/*.pt
!week7/phase28_text_ensemble/models/*.pt
!week7/phase32_partial_ensemble_outfittransformer/models/*.pt
!week7/phase34_csanet_random_negatives/models/*.pt

# Evaluation inputs and per-query results for the final systems are small and
# are what the reported numbers are computed from, so they are kept.
!week8/phase36_paper_prerequisites/data/
!week8/phase36_paper_prerequisites/data/**

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Task briefs: step-by-step instructions written to drive each phase's run.
# They are working instructions, not documentation of what happened; the
# as-built record for every phase is its phaseN_notes.md inside the phase
# folder, which is tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
week*/*.md
!week1/dataset_summary_week1.md
week4/phase19_feature_weighting/phase21_zero_shared_dial.md
week7/phase27_text_and_category/phase29_cross_attention.md
week7/phase30_multi_aspect/phase34_csanet_random_negatives.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not published yet / internal
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
paper/
progress_report/
modal/
CLAUDE.md
PROJECT_MEMORY.md
week4_report.doc
week6_report_update_brief.md
Weekly Implementation Plan_MitacsGRI_Haseeb.pdf

# Word-processor report deliverables written for supervision (same class as
